--Description: We want two things in one result set:
-- 1) the player who has appeared in the greatest number of WINNING matches,
-- 2) the player who has appeared in the greatest number of LOSING matches.
-- Steps inside the single query:
--   A. Build two CTEs that list every player-slot (pid) that belonged to the
